A dependency-free SpreadsheetML reader and writer on node:zlib: the zip's
central directory, shared strings, sheet rows, Excel serial dates. It is
the one thing the tape reader needs that is neither the kernel nor ours,
and it is kept as his so a re-sync is a copy rather than a merge. Lint
and Prettier skip this directory for that reason (root eslint.config.mjs
and .prettierignore). The same license condition as packages/kernel
applies: his repository carries no LICENSE file.

Local changes to his file: none.
